DE:
Du wieder?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Steh hier nicht rum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Such dir 'nen Platz und kipp dir 'nen
Kaffee rein!

ES:
Cuando se trata de café,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no tomo
nada que no sea {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}blue mountain{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
Aromático,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} intenso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} dulce...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡No hay nada como el café
de tipo blue mountain!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bueno,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} cada uno tiene sus gustos...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Puede gustarte otro, claro, pero
no es culpa mía si te equivocas.

IT:
Io bevo sempre solo {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}caffè ristretto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
Proprio così!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}L'aroma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} il gusto ricco...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Ah, non c'è niente di meglio, sì!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ehm...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Naturalmente ognuno
ha i suoi gusti {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}ed è libero
di pensarla come vuole. Sì, sì!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Adding milk to your coffee{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}ends
up spoiling its aroma and taste.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
Coffee is best with {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}no{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} milk!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Yeah, yeah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I don't mean to say
anything about how you drink your
coffee.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Even though I already did.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ah, no.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Il latte rovina
l'aroma e il gusto del caffè.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
Per me {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}niente {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}latte{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ops, scusa.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Magari tu lo prendi con
il latte. Non volevo criticare i gusti
degli altri.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Ma l'ho fatto lo stesso...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Kahveye şeker mi{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}?{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} Olmaz! DELİ{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
MİSİN?! Öyle bir şey{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} koyarsan
kahvenin doğal tatlılığını
tadamazsın{{TAG:0003:0000:}}! Neyse{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}, belki sen
daha tatlı seviyorsundur.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Herkesin zevki kendine.

Köstebek tünel kazarken aslında{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
salyangozdan yavaş ilerler
derler{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}. Duydun mu? Hiç{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
salyangozla yarışmadım, doğru mu{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}
bilmiyorum... Ama düşün{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}!{{TAG:0003:0006:}} Ben
TOPRAK ve{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} KAYA kazıyorum,
salyangoz sadece YÜRÜYOR! Bizi{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
kıyaslamak saçma! Kazmayla
geçecek kadar{{TAG:0003:0006:}} tünel açmak ZOR!
Bu arada{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} evine{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} giden tüneli
çoktan kazdım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}; gerekirse{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}} ANINDA
oradayım! Her{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ihtimali planlarım!
